    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1163350/extras/20eeadebf1b38c1db366b7b7c42ae0ce.poster.avif?t=1740509702\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1163350/extras/20eeadebf1b38c1db366b7b7c42ae0ce.webm?t=1740509702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Property Tycoon gives you a unique chance to create your own real estate business. Buy devastated flats, houses and commercial premises all around the city.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1163350/extras/fef5e2badd1d863a1e817024d62763f8.poster.avif?t=1740509702\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1163350/extras/fef5e2badd1d863a1e817024d62763f8.webm?t=1740509702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Repair broken and damaged properties. There are different variations of finish, choose them carefully not everyone can afford luxury.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1163350/extras/cbb0dda9838c3f0337a2a5d82432f53d.poster.avif?t=1740509702\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1163350/extras/cbb0dda9838c3f0337a2a5d82432f53d.webm?t=1740509702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>In a massive city of House Flipper, you need to manage your properties. Selling them it's one way to make money, but the good businessman knows there are any different possibilities. What about renting them to make easy profit each month?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1163350/extras/08b7a3ebac5de3012a4cc9fafe5d80a9.poster.avif?t=1740509702\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1163350/extras/08b7a3ebac5de3012a4cc9fafe5d80a9.webm?t=1740509702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Budget management its a part of our everyday life but can you estimate your profit and find the best investments out there? Will you succeed?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1163350/extras/ed6c1a2a179cae62792894a2cd238695.poster.avif?t=1740509702\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1163350/extras/ed6c1a2a179cae62792894a2cd238695.webm?t=1740509702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Real estate business is not a piece of cake. Improve your skills, get better each month and become King of a City. Will you become the richest or will you fail? It's all up to you, but most importantly HAVE FUN!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1163350/extras/20eeadebf1b38c1db366b7b7c42ae0ce.poster.avif?t=1740509702\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1163350/extras/20eeadebf1b38c1db366b7b7c42ae0ce.webm?t=1740509702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Property Tycoon gives you a unique chance to create your own real estate business. Buy devastated flats, houses and commercial premises all around the city.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1163350/extras/fef5e2badd1d863a1e817024d62763f8.poster.avif?t=1740509702\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1163350/extras/fef5e2badd1d863a1e817024d62763f8.webm?t=1740509702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Repair broken and damaged properties. There are different variations of finish, choose them carefully not everyone can afford luxury.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1163350/extras/cbb0dda9838c3f0337a2a5d82432f53d.poster.avif?t=1740509702\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1163350/extras/cbb0dda9838c3f0337a2a5d82432f53d.webm?t=1740509702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>In a massive city of House Flipper, you need to manage your properties. Selling them it's one way to make money, but the good businessman knows there are any different possibilities. What about renting them to make easy profit each month?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video clas